{"title": "Revenant Scourge", "pageid": 28067, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Revenant_Scourge", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Revenant Scourge</b> is a passive feature that grants a bonus to attacks and damage on undead creatures.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When used against undead creatures this weapon has +1d4 bonus to Attack and Damage rolls. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Long_Arm_of_the_Gur\" title=\"The Long Arm of the Gur\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Heavy_Crossbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Long_Arm_of_the_Gur\" title=\"The Long Arm of the Gur\">The Long Arm of the Gur</a></span></li><